    <p style="margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">Join us this Thursday, and then join delegates from around the world in Manila this November for the 22nd International Electoral Awards &amp; Symposium (29 November &ndash; 3 December). Attendance is free and accommodation at The Manila Hotel is covered. Nominations open shortly.</p>

